 "complete": true,
 "notes": "Full PennDOT Coveo catalog read in browser (462 entries: 391 special organization, 53 military, 15 special fund, 2 specialty, 1 standard) and compared to all 401 game plates. 73 catalog plates missing from the game are listed as new (mostly pre-2023; years unknown); 26 have no picture because PennDOT shows an 'image to come' placeholder. Skipped motorcycle-only variants and the standard-issue plate. Spelling-only differences (Saint/St., Assn/Association, Mt./Mount, NRA Foundation, Milton Hershey, Expeditionary Forces, NLEOMF/'National Law Enforcement Officers Medal', SAR, Colebrookdale, Edward Francis, Video Game Clubs, Mario Lemieux, Allied Foreign, WVU, IUP, AFSCME, Combat Infantryman) were treated as the same plate and not listed. 'American Legion' is new: the game only has the Auxiliary and Sons. All listed image URLs loaded in the browser at plate shape (~2:1). Pennsylvania Masons -> Masonic Blue Lodge and Zoological Council -> Zoological Society are judgement calls."
}